# Development files kept locally, never committed.
/AGENTS.md
/PLAN.md
/TODO.md
/ISSUES.md
/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md
/docs/dev/
# Scratch and development tools; build trees and deployment receipts; release archives.
/work/
/build/
/dist/
/src/core-*/build/
/src/core-*/dist/
/src/shared/romanian/build/
# Firmware, tapes, disks and other third-party files: in the release's assets archive, never committed
# (tools/assets.py). A core's own sources among its assets (*.py, *.asm) are committed.
/src/core-*/assets/**
!/src/core-*/assets/**/
!/src/core-*/assets/**/*.py
!/src/core-*/assets/**/*.asm
# Reference documents the tools download, and working notes on them.
/docs/*/reference/
/docs/*/analysis/
# Tool output.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
